# A receiver that talks NMEA but has no fix yet: "Searching", no dot (a position would be a lie).
title GPS: searching
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED searching
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot searching
expect text "Searching"
expect notext "No GPS device"
